# WCNP/squiggly deploy config is GEC-INTERNAL ONLY — it carries internal Walmart
# infra (cluster IDs, Akeyless paths, *.walmart.net hosts) and must never land in
# this public repo. The canonical copies live on the internal GEC deploy repo's
# main branch. Ignored here so `git add -A` in the public tree can't leak them.
/kitt.yml
/kitt-dsui.yml
/Dockerfile.chronicle
/Dockerfile.dsui
/.looper.yml
/deploy/
/sr.yaml
/testburst.properties
